  },
  {
   "claim": "At first it seems to show a young married couple or perhaps a brother and sister",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/art/art-terms/p/pre-raphaelite/why-were-pre-raphaelites-so-shocking"
  },
  {
   "claim": "She wears rings on every finger except the wedding finger; she is not his wife but his mistress, in an apartment he has provided for her",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/art/art-terms/p/pre-raphaelite/why-were-pre-raphaelites-so-shocking ; https://shafe.co.uk/?p=6136 ; https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-britain/display/historic-early-modern-british-art/1845-1904 ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Awakening_Conscience"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Under the table a cat toys with a bird that is trying to escape",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-britain/display/historic-early-modern-british-art/1845-1904 ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Awakening_Conscience ; https://victorianweb.org/painting/whh/paintings/9.html"
  },
  {
   "claim": "A fallen, cast-off glove on the floor hints that she will be discarded (Tate's reading)",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/art/art-terms/p/pre-raphaelite/why-were-pre-raphaelites-so-shocking ; https://shafe.co.uk/?p=6136"
  },
  {
   "claim": "The tune he idly plays on the piano reminds her of her earlier life, and she rises from his lap towards the bright outside world, seen in the mirror",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-britain/display/historic-early-modern-british-art/1845-1904"
  },
  {
   "claim": "The clock on the piano is under glass; Tate's label: a female figure enclosed in a glass dome",
   "source": "https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-britain/display/historic-early-modern-british-art/1845-1904 ; https://shafe.co.uk/?p=6136 ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Awakening_Conscience"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Ruskin defended the picture in a letter to The Times (1854): not a single object in the room but it becomes tragical if read rightly",
   "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Awakening_Conscience ; https://shafe.co.uk/?p=6136"
  },
